WEBVTT

00:00:23.947 --> 00:00:25.294
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> What’s the date today?

00:00:25.707 --> 00:00:29.223
<v><b>Alan:</b></v> I think it’s the 2nd of June.

00:00:29.730 --> 00:00:32.472
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> Are you sure? Isn’t it the 1st?

00:00:34.627 --> 00:00:36.280
<v><b>Alan:</b></v> No, definitely the 2nd.

00:00:37.592 --> 00:00:38.759
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> Oh no!

00:00:39.472 --> 00:00:41.193
It’s my dad’s birthday.